  "title": "Uruguayan fans will soon enjoy a new way to discover, buy and access live events with the arrival of Ticketmaster",
  "summary": "Fans across Uruguay will soon enjoy, through Ticketmaster, a ticket-buying experience designed to make accessing live events simpler, safer and more transparent. Starting today, ticketmaster.uy is live, allowing fans to create an account and get ready to purchase tickets for upcoming live events, which will be available through Ticketmaster. As part of its launch in Uruguay,…",
